lines = PackedStringArray("Running diagnostics... uh oh.", "A micrometeoroid smashed the MAIN POWER COUPLING on the outer hull.", "Someone has to go outside and rewire it. And, well... you\'re the only someone aboard.", "The airlock door is open. Suit up, engineer!")
